{"h":3395,"lines":[{"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"t":"G","x":0.076131687277278204,"y":0.54069767419203929,"w":0.016460905075073237},{"w":0.082843818664550817,"x":0.833087216648704,"t":"Reading","c":1,"y":0.06338090535900287,"h":0.016103099737627913},{"w":0.70576131184895829,"t":"Shenggen Fan, Director General of the International Food Policy Research","x":0.12551440571871231,"y":0.11042402837004661,"h":0.017482948527880904,"c":1},{"x":0.12340028462256138,"y":0.12653054797341334,"w":0.74495732625325528,"t":"Institute, held up social safety nets and public welfare programmes in Ethiopia,","c":1,"h":0.020457367734156406},{"w":0.74497548421223958,"c":1,"h":0.019253547677443361,"y":0.14498047454676644,"t":"Brazil and Mexico as valuable ways to address poverty among farming families","x":0.12545727783114047},{"x":0.12339966268922259,"y":0.16242489233512147,"c":1,"h":0.019767314160530125,"t":"and reduce their vulnerability to agriculture shocks. However, some commentators","w":0.77584086100260419},{"w":0.74279836018880208,"h":0.015990084276322869,"c":1,"y":0.18168433446812438,"x":0.12139917375663174,"t":"responded that cash transfers to poor families do not necessarily translate into"},{"w":0.73058222452799482,"t":"increased tood security, as these programmes do not always strengthen food","x":0.12134683711598361,"h":0.018284663996791961,"c":1,"y":0.19889018471142106},{"c":1,"t":"production or raise incomes. Regarding state subsidies for agriculture, Rokeya","x":0.12345677871745475,"w":0.74074076334635408,"h":0.017667844522968212,"y":0.21790341563693072},{"h":0.017479524735988683,"c":1,"t":"Kabir, Executive Director of Bangladesh Nari Progati Sangha, commented in her","y":0.23546511611978893,"w":0.75925923665364581,"x":0.12345680131678402},{"x":0.12340046057620213,"t":"essay that these 'have not compensated for the stranglehold exercised by private","h":0.018899807519991318,"w":0.76760340372721358,"c":1,"y":0.25157162459153504},{"y":0.26910081159141142,"t":"traders. In fact, studies show that sixty percent of beneficiaries of subsidies are not","x":0.12133445112830506,"w":0.78412653605143223,"h":0.020158915974647362,"c":1},{"w":0.47804545084635425,"h":0.023765271909104824,"c":1,"x":0.12313754295166685,"t":"poor, but rich landowners and non-farmer traders.'","y":0.28488402898495258},{"w":0.77787790934244783,"t":"Nwanze, Murphy and Fan argued that private risk management tools, like private","y":0.31510302841096516,"h":0.019431948802215548,"x":0.10901333401283646,"c":1},{"w":0.7345679219563801,"t":"insurance, commodity futures markets, and rural finance can help small-scale","h":0.017667844522968323,"x":0.12139916648948429,"c":1,"y":0.33421672557006565},{"t":"producers mitigate risk and allow for investment in improvements. Kabir warned","h":0.016041444524578563,"w":0.75308639526367183,"c":1,"x":0.12139918911686445,"y":0.35174418590020518},{"t":"that financial support schemes often encourage the adoption of high-input","h":0.01906059431383833,"w":0.70177439371744799,"c":1,"x":0.12133740354886205,"y":0.3680635218991698},{"x":0.12133543892917298,"h":0.019619481161991414,"y":0.38640665146657471,"t":"agricultural practices, which in the medium term may raise production costs","w":0.71412770589192709,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.016034596379148724,"t":"beyond the value of their harvests. Murphy noted that when futures markets","y":0.40547703166884896,"x":0.12139917748457066,"w":0.71810699462890626},{"t":"become excessively financialised they can contribute to short-term price volatility,","x":0.12133551500516716,"w":0.76969085693359374,"y":0.42116512447980592,"h":0.019267696654698296,"c":1},{"h":0.019410487198576853,"c":1,"y":0.4381806319370688,"w":0.74090047200520848,"t":"which increases farmers' food insecurity. Many participants and commentators","x":0.12133197906635577},{"t":"emphasised that greater transparency in markets is needed to mitigate the impact","h":0.017441860778592888,"y":0.45784883704743407,"c":1,"x":0.12139917725599057,"w":0.77572016398111965},{"w":0.78395060221354174,"h":0.015995219964160978,"x":0.12139918438506687,"t":"of volatility, and make evident whether adequate stocks and supplies are available.","y":0.47673733831684229,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.49411071843701615,"h":0.0175171886933847,"w":0.73868311564127609,"x":0.12345679600630433,"t":"Others contended that agribusiness companies should be held responsible for"},{"y":0.51148409912792414,"t":"paying for negative side effects.","x":0.12139917244976894,"w":0.30658437093098961,"h":0.017667844522968212,"c":1},{"x":0.1172839527606601,"t":"Many essayists mentioned climate change and its consequences for small-scale","y":0.53916372228356924,"w":0.76337448120117191,"h":0.017667844522968101,"c":1},{"w":0.77366256713867188,"t":"agriculture. Fan explained that in addition to reducing crop yields, climate change","h":0.017667844522968212,"y":0.55800942276946297,"x":0.121399168999028,"c":1},{"w":0.7386831156412762,"t":"increases the magnitude and the frequency of extreme weather events, which","y":0.57558139520291485,"x":0.11934156964820876,"c":1,"h":0.015996932421752819},{"y":0.59156976767624503,"t":"increase smallholder vulnerability.' The growing unpredictability of weather patterns","x":0.11934156096445928,"h":0.018895348053517669,"c":1,"w":0.78806584676106761},{"c":1,"x":0.11934156670927261,"w":0.75720163981119792,"t":"increases farmers' difficulty in managing weather-related risks. According to this","h":0.017482948527880904,"y":0.61042402836803134},{"t":"author, one solution would be to develop crop varieties that are more resilient","w":0.73271774291992187,"x":0.12129887133492598,"y":0.62703170206389625,"h":0.020043003545071381,"c":1},{"h":0.016036308275094724,"c":1,"x":0.11934155147832257,"y":0.64680232543398308,"t":"to new climate trends and extreme weather patterns. Accordingly, Pat Mooney,","w":0.74691360473632806},{"c":1,"t":"co-founder and executive director of the ETC Group, suggested that 'if we are to","x":0.12139917096124596,"w":0.76131688435872391,"y":0.66424418588435663,"h":0.017441860778592888},{"c":1,"y":0.68313953473705014,"h":0.015988372380376759,"t":"survive climate change, we must adopt policies that let peasants diversity the plant","x":0.11934155396595325,"w":0.78600824991861973},{"w":0.63388595581054685,"c":1,"y":0.69909762574394718,"h":0.018728735870972346,"t":"and animal species and varieties\/breeds that make up our menus.?","x":0.11928475075994205},{"t":"37","c":1,"x":0.88683127535742001,"y":0.93459302297890068,"h":0.01598837238037687,"w":0.02880658467610675},{"w":0.20827172597249349,"y":0.96768258547277797,"h":0.01645441358586508,"c":1,"x":0.39483721539984068,"t":"leltsresources.org"}],"w":2400}